WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:05,167
Tayangan berikut
hanya untuk penonton dewasa.

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:07,000
Kebijaksanaan pemirsa disarankan.

3
00:01:19,125 --> 00:01:20,208
Empat puluh satu…

4
00:02:15,792 --> 00:02:18,500
Semalam, terjadi satu lagi pembunuhan
di Little Sicily.

5
00:02:18,583 --> 00:02:20,917
Baik polisi maupun warga
sama-sama bereaksi

6
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:24,375
terhadap naiknya kejahatan di siang bolong
di Little Sicily.

7
00:02:24,458 --> 00:02:26,250
Gila, di sini mengerikan!

8
00:02:26,333 --> 00:02:29,083
Saat orang takut merampok dan mencuri,
semuanya baik.

9
00:02:29,167 --> 00:02:30,167
Kini? Semua kacau.

10
00:02:30,250 --> 00:02:32,250
Melangkah keluar rumah saja tidak bisa.

11
00:02:32,333 --> 00:02:34,333
Terserah bilang apa soal keluarga Gnucci,

12
00:02:34,417 --> 00:02:36,042
setidaknya mereka jaga ketenangan.

13
00:02:36,125 --> 00:02:39,875
Pendaftaran dan moral polisi
menurun drastis beberapa minggu ini,

14
00:02:39,958 --> 00:02:43,333
dan banyak anggota kepolisian
menyebut kematian Bobby Gnucci…

15
00:02:43,417 --> 00:02:44,417
Jangan lakukan itu!

16
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:46,500
- Hei, Johnny!
- Hei!

17
00:02:46,583 --> 00:02:47,750
RESTORAN Gnucci

18
00:02:47,833 --> 00:02:49,083
Jangan lakukan itu, ya?

19
00:02:51,417 --> 00:02:52,583
Ke sini, Cammo.

20
00:02:53,833 --> 00:02:55,458
Sedikit Italia, ya?

21
00:02:56,333 --> 00:02:57,708
Ini cukup.

22
00:02:58,333 --> 00:03:01,083
Mussolini fettuccini scallopini

23
00:03:05,958 --> 00:03:08,625
Tak ada Cadillac lagi di sini, ya?

24
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:14,917
Tak ada lagi bos-bosan,
dan orang-orang sok penting.

25
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,667
Semua preman Gnucci itu sudah pergi.

26
00:03:21,917 --> 00:03:24,708
Kau akan makan hari ini, Cammo.

27
00:03:24,792 --> 00:03:27,167
Ya, benar!

28
00:03:28,292 --> 00:03:30,125
Baiklah.

29
00:03:38,375 --> 00:03:39,625
Ding-dong!

30
00:03:44,875 --> 00:03:45,917
Sial!

31
00:03:54,375 --> 00:03:56,333
- Hei!
- Siapa anjing yang pintar?

32
00:03:56,417 --> 00:03:57,417
Letakkan anjingku!

33
00:03:57,500 --> 00:04:00,875
- Ya, kau anjing pintar.
- Hei!

34
00:04:00,958 --> 00:04:04,167
Hei, Kau! Letakkan anjingku!

35
00:04:04,833 --> 00:04:06,833
- Lepaskan dia! Cammo!
- Ya, memang kau.

36
00:04:06,917 --> 00:04:09,042
Ya, itu kau. Kau anjing kecil yang pintar.

37
00:04:09,125 --> 00:04:11,833
- Letakkan! Jangan ganggu anjingku!
- Ya, memang kau.

38
00:04:11,917 --> 00:04:13,250
Selamat tinggal!

39
00:04:18,458 --> 00:04:19,708
Selamat tinggal, Pak Tua!

40
00:04:21,750 --> 00:04:22,750
Hei, ayolah.

41
00:04:23,708 --> 00:04:25,083
Ada Ayah.

42
00:04:25,167 --> 00:04:27,958
Tenanglah, tenang.
Mereka hanya main-main, ya?

43
00:04:28,042 --> 00:04:30,250
Kita harus hati-hati
dengan anak-anak gila itu.

44
00:04:30,333 --> 00:04:33,583
Kau harus hati-hati, paham?
Ibu bilang kau…

45
00:04:37,167 --> 00:04:38,542
Aku tahu bahwa ini pilihanku

46
00:04:38,625 --> 00:04:40,917
dan murni pilihanku
untuk jadi Marinir Pengintai.

47
00:04:42,875 --> 00:04:45,292
Kuterima semua tantangan
yang terkait profesi ini.

48
00:04:46,917 --> 00:04:50,042
Aku akan berusaha selamanya
untuk menjaga reputasi tinggi

49
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:52,250
para pendahuluku.

50
00:04:52,875 --> 00:04:54,458
Melampaui batasan,

51
00:04:55,042 --> 00:04:56,208
yang dibuat orang lain,

52
00:04:56,875 --> 00:04:58,000
akan menjadi tujuanku.

53
00:04:58,750 --> 00:05:00,333
Mengorbankan kenyamanan pribadi.

54
00:05:01,375 --> 00:05:04,375
Mendedikasikan diriku untuk
menyelesaikan misi pengintaian

55
00:05:04,458 --> 00:05:05,792
akan menjadi hidupku.

56
00:05:05,875 --> 00:05:09,250
Kebugaran fisik, mental, dan etika tinggi.

57
00:05:09,333 --> 00:05:12,833
Gelar "Marinir Pengintai"
adalah kehormatan bagiku.

58
00:05:13,708 --> 00:05:16,833
Sudah selesai. Tak ada lagi yang tersisa.

59
00:05:18,167 --> 00:05:19,500
Kasihan Frank.

60
00:05:20,625 --> 00:05:21,917
Aku takkan pernah berhenti.

61
00:05:22,667 --> 00:05:25,167
Berhenti, menyerah…

62
00:05:26,542 --> 00:05:27,792
sama saja gagal.

63
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,750
Berhenti? Menyerah?
Menyerah berarti gagal?

64
00:05:51,833 --> 00:05:54,875
- Maka berhenti! Hanya itu kemampuanmu?
- Kau lebih baik dariku.

65
00:05:55,625 --> 00:05:57,708
Jauh lebih baik dariku.

66
00:05:57,792 --> 00:05:59,375
Aku kira kau yang terbaik!

67
00:05:59,458 --> 00:06:01,417
Kau tak bisa mendengarnya?

68
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:03,417
Bagaimana dengan kami?

69
00:06:06,833 --> 00:06:07,875
Bicaralah padaku.

70
00:06:08,875 --> 00:06:10,875
Ceritakan apa yang terjadi.

71
00:06:10,958 --> 00:06:14,917
Apa pun yang kau butuh dariku,
aku ada di sini.

72
00:06:19,542 --> 00:06:20,958
Rasanya aku butuh bantuan.

73
00:06:22,708 --> 00:06:24,458
Rasanya aku butuh bantuan.

74
00:06:30,292 --> 00:06:31,417
Baiklah, Curt.

75
00:06:33,208 --> 00:06:34,292
Baiklah.

76
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:58,625
KORPS MARINIR AMERIKA SERIKAT

77
00:06:58,708 --> 00:07:01,042
Isaiah, jangan dribel bola di lorong.

78
00:07:05,792 --> 00:07:07,875
- Ayo, Sayang.
- Itu dia.

79
00:07:10,125 --> 00:07:11,625
Ternyata dia keluar juga.

80
00:07:20,208 --> 00:07:21,958
Lepaskan aku! Hentikan!

81
00:07:22,042 --> 00:07:23,208
Hai, selamat pagi.

82
00:07:23,292 --> 00:07:25,375
Pergi dari sini. Jangan ganggu aku.

83
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,833
Hei, Debbie! Tunggu.

84
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:45,000
Charli, kau membuat hati untuk Ayah,
bukan menghancurkan, 'kan?

85
00:07:45,083 --> 00:07:46,792
Baiklah, gadis baik.

86
00:07:46,875 --> 00:07:50,625
Pastikan bebas gluten, 'kan?
Ini. Selamat menikmati.

87
00:07:50,708 --> 00:07:53,375
- Aku mau yang itu…
- Dennis, sudah waktunya minum kopi?

88
00:07:53,458 --> 00:07:55,667
Jangan potong antrean.
Tunggu di sana saja.

89
00:07:55,750 --> 00:07:59,125
…masih terguncang karena kematian
keluarga kriminal Gnucci yang tenar.

90
00:07:59,208 --> 00:08:01,875
Kekerasan dan ketegangan
memenuhi jalanan Little Sicily

91
00:08:01,958 --> 00:08:04,917
karena vakum kekuasaan
membuat lingkungan itu menjadi rawan.

92
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:07,542
- Kotor!
- Dennis! Pergi ke sana.

93
00:08:07,625 --> 00:08:11,042
Konon, mantan veteran pelaku vigilantisme,
Frank Castle, alias Punisher,

94
00:08:11,125 --> 00:08:12,958
adalah pelaku utama pembunuhan ini

95
00:08:13,042 --> 00:08:16,708
setelah keluarga Gnucci diduga termasuk
organisasi kriminal terakhir terkait

96
00:08:16,792 --> 00:08:18,292
kematian keluarganya.

97
00:08:18,375 --> 00:08:21,125
Keberadaan Frank Castle
tetap tidak diketahui.

98
00:08:21,208 --> 00:08:22,542
Aku tahu kau ada di dalam.

99
00:08:22,625 --> 00:08:24,208
…bersikap seperti itu.

100
00:08:25,042 --> 00:08:26,750
Terima kasih banyak.

101
00:08:26,833 --> 00:08:28,708
Laki-laki landak.

102
00:08:28,792 --> 00:08:31,583
Baiklah, ini dia.
Terima kasih sudah membeli.

103
00:08:31,667 --> 00:08:33,833
- Mereka datang…
- Baiklah. Tenang. Ayo.

104
00:08:33,917 --> 00:08:35,000
Lihat aku. Lihat aku.

105
00:08:36,250 --> 00:08:37,750
Baiklah. Jaga diri.

106
00:08:37,833 --> 00:08:38,833
Tunggu di sana.

107
00:08:38,917 --> 00:08:40,875
- Bawa dia keluar.
- Antar Charli sekolah,

108
00:08:40,958 --> 00:08:43,958
aku akan urus dia.
Tolong antar Charli sekolah. Terima kasih.

109
00:08:44,042 --> 00:08:46,583
- Ayo, Sayang. Ambil barangmu.
- Mereka datang!

110
00:08:47,917 --> 00:08:50,167
Sudah cukup! Sudah. Keluar.

111
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:52,542
Tak apa, Charli, ya? Ayah hanya bercanda.

112
00:08:52,625 --> 00:08:53,958
Nikmati harimu di sekolah.

113
00:08:54,042 --> 00:08:55,917
Dia tidak butuh kopi, dia butuh obat.

114
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,833
Debbie, mana pena biruku?
Kenapa tak ada di keranjang?

115
00:08:59,500 --> 00:09:01,750
Karena ada di belakang telingamu, Andre.

116
00:09:05,542 --> 00:09:08,333
Tidak usah bayar. Aku traktir.
Maaf atas keributan tadi.

117
00:09:10,917 --> 00:09:12,083
Nikmati harimu.

118
00:09:28,708 --> 00:09:30,750
Astaga! Mereka akan bunuh kita!

119
00:09:30,833 --> 00:09:32,292
Mereka di dalam tembok!

120
00:09:32,375 --> 00:09:36,500
Mereka akan habisi kita! Mereka akan…

121
00:09:37,667 --> 00:09:39,958
Mereka akan habisi kita!
Mereka di dalam tembok!

122
00:09:40,042 --> 00:09:42,208
Mereka di dalam tembok!

123
00:09:44,958 --> 00:09:46,292
Hai, Kakek! Hajar dia!

124
00:09:46,375 --> 00:09:48,333
Ayo, hajar tua bangka ini.

125
00:09:53,708 --> 00:09:54,958
Selamat tinggal, Pak Tua!

126
00:09:56,583 --> 00:09:59,708
Tidak, kau gagal! Dasar wanita berengsek!

127
00:10:07,708 --> 00:10:10,583
Hei, kenapa kau selalu berkeliaran?
Pergi sana!

128
00:10:10,667 --> 00:10:12,417
Cepat pergi sana.

129
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:14,375
Pergi sana. Terus jalan.

130
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:19,917
- Aku butuh petugas medis!
- Tinggalkan tokoku.

131
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,417
Kau tak boleh mencuri dariku.

132
00:10:27,417 --> 00:10:28,708
Tidak!

133
00:10:32,792 --> 00:10:34,833
Tim lapangan, ini 3-2-alfa.

134
00:10:34,917 --> 00:10:36,708
Angkat senjata itu!

135
00:10:38,833 --> 00:10:40,333
Cooper luka! Butuh tim medis!

136
00:10:40,417 --> 00:10:42,000
Viper-7, ini…

137
00:10:43,667 --> 00:10:45,875
…terkepung! Kami terkepung!

138
00:11:07,042 --> 00:11:09,500
Putra tercinta
Semoga kenangannya abadi

139
00:11:09,583 --> 00:11:13,542
Putri tercinta
Selalu mencintai, selalu dicintai

140
00:11:13,625 --> 00:11:14,875
Mengenang dalam kasih

141
00:11:14,958 --> 00:11:16,167
Istri dan ibu penyayang

142
00:11:25,958 --> 00:11:26,958
Hei, Sayang.

143
00:11:32,583 --> 00:11:33,583
Sudah berusaha keras.

144
00:11:46,750 --> 00:11:47,917
Kau di sini, Anak Manis?

145
00:11:57,958 --> 00:11:59,208
Kau begitu…

146
00:11:59,292 --> 00:12:00,750
Kau jauh sekali dari Ayah.

147
00:12:11,583 --> 00:12:12,958
Sayang, waktu kau kecil…

148
00:12:16,083 --> 00:12:17,333
kau tidak bisa tidur.

149
00:12:21,292 --> 00:12:23,125
Ayah kitiki lenganmu,

150
00:12:23,208 --> 00:12:25,333
tiga kali, Sayang, lalu kau pulas.
Itu saja.

151
00:12:29,167 --> 00:12:32,000
Ayah sudah bilang tak akan berhenti
dan tak akan menyerah.

152
00:12:35,875 --> 00:12:36,875
Sayang…

153
00:12:38,500 --> 00:12:39,500
Sayang, Ayah…

154
00:12:42,333 --> 00:12:43,542
tak tahu harus bagaimana.

155
00:12:44,167 --> 00:12:45,792
Tak ada lagi yang tersisa.

156
00:12:51,667 --> 00:12:52,875
Ayah sangat lelah.

157
00:12:59,167 --> 00:13:00,292
Ayah lelah.

158
00:13:07,167 --> 00:13:08,667
Maafkan Ayah, Sayang.

159
00:13:09,708 --> 00:13:10,958
Ayah.

160
00:13:15,583 --> 00:13:19,083
Tolong naik, Ayah. Naiklah, ke atas.

161
00:13:21,458 --> 00:13:24,917
Hei, Ayah! Lihat ini!

162
00:13:29,458 --> 00:13:32,000
Ayah! Ayah lihat tidak?

163
00:13:32,083 --> 00:13:33,292
Bacakan buku ini untukku.

164
00:13:34,875 --> 00:13:36,833
Ayah, buku ini.

165
00:13:38,125 --> 00:13:39,750
Kumohon, Ayah.

166
00:13:39,833 --> 00:13:41,292
Ayah lelah, Sayang.

167
00:13:41,375 --> 00:13:44,417
Ayolah, Ayah. Kumohon.

168
00:13:45,625 --> 00:13:47,125
- Ayah.
- Ayah lelah.

169
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,542
Ayah! Ayah tidak melihatnya?

170
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:54,417
Hei. Aku sayang kamu.

171
00:13:56,250 --> 00:13:57,625
Halo…

172
00:13:57,708 --> 00:14:02,042
SETUMPUK
DUA TUMPUK

173
00:14:02,125 --> 00:14:03,917
Halo.

174
00:14:14,583 --> 00:14:15,625
Ayah?

175
00:14:17,292 --> 00:14:19,042
Ayah, aku kenapa?

176
00:14:23,708 --> 00:14:25,417
Ayah!

177
00:14:27,792 --> 00:14:29,167
Ayah!

178
00:14:29,250 --> 00:14:31,583
Kau tak betah di sini, 'kan?
Jadi, pergi sana!

179
00:14:31,667 --> 00:14:34,833
Selamat. Kau dapat yang kau inginkan.

180
00:14:34,917 --> 00:14:36,583
Ayah, buat ini berhenti!

181
00:14:41,708 --> 00:14:43,042
Ayah baik-baik saja?

182
00:14:44,375 --> 00:14:47,500
Hei. Hei, hei.

183
00:14:50,542 --> 00:14:53,125
Hei. Hei.

184
00:15:06,792 --> 00:15:08,125
Hei, hei.

185
00:15:09,333 --> 00:15:10,708
Hei. Ayah…

186
00:15:17,833 --> 00:15:18,833
Tunggu.

187
00:15:19,583 --> 00:15:21,792
Tidak. Tidak, tidak, tidak!

188
00:15:21,875 --> 00:15:25,000
Tidak, tidak, tidak! Tidak!

189
00:15:25,083 --> 00:15:26,750
Sayang, kembali!

190
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,583
Kembalilah!

191
00:15:33,458 --> 00:15:34,917
Maafkan Ayah.

192
00:15:43,708 --> 00:15:46,667
Menurutmu Tuhan akan memaafkan
semua perbuatan kita, Frank?

193
00:15:49,333 --> 00:15:51,833
Aku tak yakin Dia akan memaafkanku.
Namun, kau?

194
00:15:52,917 --> 00:15:54,958
Aku tahu kau takkan mungkin dimaafkan.

195
00:15:56,875 --> 00:15:59,458
Apa, kau tak bisa senyum? Itu lucu.

196
00:16:00,375 --> 00:16:02,792
Aku paham, kau sedang cengeng.

197
00:16:03,792 --> 00:16:04,792
Sudah selesai.

198
00:16:05,708 --> 00:16:06,958
Tak ada lagi yang tersisa.

199
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,333
Kasihan Frank.

200
00:16:10,500 --> 00:16:12,667
Apa tujuanmu sekarang, Marinir?

201
00:17:01,625 --> 00:17:03,000
Frank Castle.

202
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:12,083
Maaf jika aku mengagetkanmu.

203
00:17:13,458 --> 00:17:16,958
Nenek-nenek,
tahu namamu, tempat tinggalmu.

204
00:17:19,875 --> 00:17:20,875
Frank?

205
00:17:22,958 --> 00:17:24,125
Aku butuh bantuanmu.

206
00:17:25,625 --> 00:17:26,625
Jadi…

207
00:17:27,500 --> 00:17:29,125
keluargaku direnggut.

208
00:17:30,500 --> 00:17:31,500
Hanya…

209
00:17:33,042 --> 00:17:34,083
Anak yang manis.

210
00:17:35,292 --> 00:17:37,500
Sayang sekali dia harus tumbuh
dalam kekumuhan.

211
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:41,375
Boleh kuceritakan sebuah kisah pendek?

212
00:17:44,708 --> 00:17:47,000
Seluruh keluargaku, Frank!

213
00:17:48,542 --> 00:17:49,875
Sama sepertimu.

214
00:17:54,458 --> 00:17:55,750
Kesepian…

215
00:17:57,167 --> 00:17:58,333
Benar, Frank?

216
00:18:00,042 --> 00:18:01,083
Seperti rasa lapar

217
00:18:02,292 --> 00:18:03,333
yang mengerikan…

218
00:18:04,417 --> 00:18:06,708
menyiksa, selalu ada,

219
00:18:06,792 --> 00:18:09,417
dan tak bisa kau lupakan.

220
00:18:11,750 --> 00:18:13,000
Namun…

221
00:18:13,833 --> 00:18:15,083
bagi kau dan aku, Frank…

222
00:18:19,333 --> 00:18:20,458
hanya itu milik kita.

223
00:18:24,792 --> 00:18:27,208
Benny, suamiku, dia yang pertama.

224
00:18:27,292 --> 00:18:29,500
Siapa yang lebih baik dariku?

225
00:18:29,583 --> 00:18:33,167
Mengingat profesinya,
aku terkejut dia tak mati lebih cepat.

226
00:18:35,167 --> 00:18:38,625
Dia pulang malam,
bau parfum murahan pelacur,

227
00:18:38,708 --> 00:18:42,000
lipstik jelek berceceran di kerahnya.

228
00:18:50,750 --> 00:18:52,083
Bobby.

229
00:18:53,250 --> 00:18:55,167
Anak sulungku. Dia berikutnya.

230
00:18:56,250 --> 00:18:58,458
Dia polisi yang hebat.

231
00:18:58,542 --> 00:19:01,833
Dia memecahkan banyak kasus
yang tak bisa dipecahkan orang lain.

232
00:19:11,750 --> 00:19:13,250
Dia dibantai.

233
00:19:25,042 --> 00:19:26,208
Lalu, ada Eddie.

234
00:19:27,333 --> 00:19:31,333
Eddie… dia menghidupkan suasana
di mana pun dia berada.

235
00:19:31,417 --> 00:19:33,458
Dia membangun keluarganya sendiri.

236
00:19:43,792 --> 00:19:45,375
Sungguh menyenangkan…

237
00:19:46,833 --> 00:19:48,500
melihat anak-anakmu berkeluarga.

238
00:19:52,625 --> 00:19:54,792
Lalu, ada pangeranku.

239
00:19:59,125 --> 00:20:01,750
Carlo-ku yang tampan.

240
00:20:03,125 --> 00:20:04,750
Apa pun tuduhan orang,

241
00:20:04,833 --> 00:20:08,083
aku tahu dia tak pernah menyentuh
satu pun anak-anak itu.

242
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:12,875
Tangannya tak kotor
seperti saudara-saudaranya.

243
00:20:14,083 --> 00:20:15,625
Dia pemikir.

244
00:20:16,250 --> 00:20:18,542
Pikirannya adalah senjatanya.

245
00:20:22,333 --> 00:20:25,375
"Semua baik-baik saja, Ma."
Katanya padaku.

246
00:20:25,958 --> 00:20:28,542
Namun, aku tahu pangeran manisku salah.

247
00:20:28,625 --> 00:20:30,417
Kami tidak baik-baik saja.

248
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:34,333
Kami tidak akan pernah
baik-baik saja lagi.

249
00:20:36,083 --> 00:20:38,125
Pukul 18.47…

250
00:20:38,667 --> 00:20:43,333
Waktu yang akan membekas
di hatiku selamanya.

251
00:20:45,125 --> 00:20:49,417
Kau seperti hewan kelaparan

252
00:20:51,333 --> 00:20:54,208
yang rakus.

253
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:58,250
Kau merenggut semua…

254
00:20:59,250 --> 00:21:00,583
yang aku punya.

255
00:21:00,667 --> 00:21:01,750
Lihat aku. Lihat aku.

256
00:21:01,833 --> 00:21:03,958
- Semua akan baik-baik saja.
- Tidak, tidak.

257
00:21:04,042 --> 00:21:06,583
Jangan, jangan. Jangan, jangan!

258
00:21:16,708 --> 00:21:22,000
Di saat-saat terakhirnya, dia hanya
ingin memastikan aku baik-baik saja.

259
00:21:22,083 --> 00:21:24,500
- Bahwa aku tak takut.
- Tak apa-apa.

260
00:21:25,583 --> 00:21:29,333
"Aku sayang kamu, Ma," katanya padaku.

261
00:21:33,333 --> 00:21:34,833
Namun…

262
00:21:34,917 --> 00:21:38,583
kau lupa satu hal.

263
00:21:42,917 --> 00:21:46,042
Kau melupakan aku, ya?

264
00:21:55,083 --> 00:21:57,875
Aku hanya perlu mengumumkan
imbalan kecil untuk nyawamu.

265
00:21:58,750 --> 00:22:00,958
Semua orang gila, penjahat, dan pembunuh

266
00:22:01,042 --> 00:22:03,583
di lingkungan ini
bekerja untuk kami, Frank.

267
00:22:03,667 --> 00:22:07,167
Sekarang, mereka nekat.

268
00:22:08,333 --> 00:22:13,042
Pada pukul 18.47,
lokasi ini akan disebarkan.

269
00:22:13,125 --> 00:22:16,667
Mereka akan datang dan membunuhmu.

270
00:22:16,750 --> 00:22:19,458
Mereka akan membunuh apa pun
yang menghalangi mereka.

271
00:22:19,542 --> 00:22:21,208
Kau sudah menabur anginmu.

272
00:22:21,292 --> 00:22:24,083
Sekarang tuailah badaimu.

273
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:34,792
Saat maut menjemputmu,

274
00:22:35,833 --> 00:22:39,708
ketahuilah bahwa keluarga Gnucci
yang mengutusnya.

275
00:22:40,792 --> 00:22:43,083
Kau tak selesaikan apa pun, Frank.

276
00:22:44,542 --> 00:22:48,208
Sekarang akulah yang menghukum.

277
00:22:51,292 --> 00:22:53,958
Ayo, Barry. Kita pergi dari sini.

278
00:22:55,875 --> 00:22:58,625
Aku akan melihatmu mati, Frank.

279
00:23:28,208 --> 00:23:29,833
Kau takut, Frank?

280
00:23:36,292 --> 00:23:38,417
Kau bukan korban. Kau yang memilih ini.

281
00:23:41,208 --> 00:23:44,625
Pulang dari penugasan,
pergi bertugas lagi besoknya, ya?

282
00:23:49,042 --> 00:23:50,917
Kau tak sabar untuk kembali ke sana.

283
00:23:51,958 --> 00:23:53,667
Kau memilih itu daripada mereka.

284
00:23:53,750 --> 00:23:57,167
- Omong kosong. Aku tidak…
- Frank, kau tak pernah mau itu. Ayah?

285
00:23:57,250 --> 00:23:58,625
Papa? Suami?

286
00:23:58,708 --> 00:24:01,875
Itu kostum. Kau tak sabar kembali
ke tempat yang masuk akalmu.

287
00:24:01,958 --> 00:24:05,292
Kau mengecewakan mereka.

288
00:24:05,375 --> 00:24:07,417
Aku tahu semua ucapanku.

289
00:24:08,208 --> 00:24:09,875
Itu semua untuk membantumu, Sobat.

290
00:24:09,958 --> 00:24:11,000
Ke mana pikiranmu?

291
00:24:11,083 --> 00:24:12,833
- Kau gagal!
- Aku kecewakan mereka!

292
00:24:12,917 --> 00:24:15,417
Kau kecewakan keluarga,
dan kini kota ini. Pengecut!

293
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:17,750
Aku tak akan pernah menyerah.

294
00:24:21,917 --> 00:24:23,458
Apa kau… sungguh di sini?

295
00:24:25,083 --> 00:24:27,917
Karen, apa kau bersamaku sekarang?

296
00:24:29,667 --> 00:24:30,667
Ya, Frank.

297
00:24:31,208 --> 00:24:32,458
Ya.

298
00:24:32,542 --> 00:24:35,083
- Ya, aku di sini.
- Hei.

299
00:24:35,792 --> 00:24:37,833
Tenanglah. Semua aman.

300
00:24:39,750 --> 00:24:40,792
Aku selalu di sini,

301
00:24:43,042 --> 00:24:44,833
tapi masih ada tugas untukmu.

302
00:24:46,667 --> 00:24:47,667
- Frank?
- Ya.

303
00:24:47,750 --> 00:24:49,250
Pukul berapa sekarang?

304
00:24:59,958 --> 00:25:01,042
Di sini! Di sini!

305
00:25:03,458 --> 00:25:04,458
Keluarlah, Frank!

306
00:25:08,583 --> 00:25:09,667
Ya.

307
00:25:09,750 --> 00:25:10,750
Ayo!

308
00:25:10,833 --> 00:25:12,292
Aku mendengarmu, Frank!

309
00:25:13,167 --> 00:25:15,875
Ayo, Frank! Di mana kau?

310
00:25:16,833 --> 00:25:19,667
Ayo! Cepat. Di mana kau?

311
00:25:19,750 --> 00:25:20,917
Keluar!

312
00:25:25,958 --> 00:25:26,958
Kau di mana?

313
00:25:27,042 --> 00:25:28,208
Minggir kau!

314
00:25:28,292 --> 00:25:30,042
Ini hari keberuntunganmu!

315
00:25:30,125 --> 00:25:31,125
Frank Castle!

316
00:25:31,958 --> 00:25:33,125
Ayo, Frank!

317
00:25:38,208 --> 00:25:40,833
- Kalian cari siapa?
- Ibu!

318
00:25:42,417 --> 00:25:44,250
Dia tidak di sini.

319
00:25:45,292 --> 00:25:46,667
Isaiah!

320
00:25:51,542 --> 00:25:55,042
Isaiah, lari! Tolong jangan ganggu kami!

321
00:25:55,833 --> 00:25:57,958
- Ibu!
- Isaiah!

322
00:25:58,042 --> 00:25:59,792
Ibu! Aku takut!

323
00:25:59,875 --> 00:26:01,292
Lari! Sekarang!

324
00:26:01,833 --> 00:26:04,542
- Tolong!
- Ibu!

325
00:26:20,083 --> 00:26:21,417
Ibu!

326
00:26:21,500 --> 00:26:22,750
Ayah!

327
00:26:24,792 --> 00:26:26,625
Ayah!

328
00:26:53,833 --> 00:26:56,833
- Lepaskan ibuku!
- Jangan ganggu aku dan putraku!

329
00:26:57,958 --> 00:26:58,958
Diam!

330
00:26:59,042 --> 00:27:00,542
Tutup mulutmu!

331
00:27:04,125 --> 00:27:06,292
Tak apa-apa, Sayang. Ayo pergi.

332
00:27:44,208 --> 00:27:45,292
Di mana dia?

333
00:28:31,625 --> 00:28:33,625
Cegat dia! Cegat dia!

334
00:28:40,625 --> 00:28:41,792
Jangan main-main, Bodoh.

335
00:28:47,167 --> 00:28:48,375
Kau mau jadi pahlawan?

336
00:28:57,250 --> 00:28:59,125
Tolong aku!

337
00:29:10,667 --> 00:29:12,417
Tolong aku! Tolong aku!

338
00:29:32,917 --> 00:29:34,083
Merunduk!

339
00:29:53,250 --> 00:29:54,583
- Aku melihatnya!
- Castle!

340
00:30:31,292 --> 00:30:33,292
- Di sana.
- …tangga.

341
00:30:33,375 --> 00:30:34,458
Lewat sini.

342
00:30:47,292 --> 00:30:48,708
Kami akan menemukanmu, Frank.

343
00:30:48,792 --> 00:30:50,042
Castle!

344
00:30:50,125 --> 00:30:51,125
Lewat sini…

345
00:31:24,250 --> 00:31:25,250
Ayo.

346
00:31:26,333 --> 00:31:27,333
Tunjukkan dirimu!

347
00:31:27,417 --> 00:31:29,125
Kami akan menemukanmu, Frank.

348
00:31:29,208 --> 00:31:30,750
Menurutmu dia ke mana?

349
00:31:30,833 --> 00:31:32,333
- Tunjukkan dirimu!
- Ayo.

350
00:31:34,583 --> 00:31:35,667
Aku melihatnya!

351
00:31:39,083 --> 00:31:40,125
Dia di sana.

352
00:31:40,958 --> 00:31:42,458
Habisi bajingan itu.

353
00:31:43,042 --> 00:31:44,792
Ayo bertarung, pengecut!

354
00:32:02,417 --> 00:32:03,500
Dia ke sini!

355
00:32:20,958 --> 00:32:21,958
Dia terpojok!

356
00:33:01,500 --> 00:33:02,792
Lumayan. Ayo habisi dia!

357
00:33:04,625 --> 00:33:07,000
- Di sana!
- Sial.

358
00:33:14,833 --> 00:33:16,458
Lepaskan aku. Ayolah!

359
00:33:16,542 --> 00:33:17,542
Apa yang kau…

360
00:33:18,333 --> 00:33:19,875
Sial…

361
00:33:39,042 --> 00:33:40,042
Minggir!

362
00:33:43,292 --> 00:33:45,458
Si bajingan Frank Castle! Kemari!

363
00:33:56,250 --> 00:33:57,500
Keluar dari tokoku.

364
00:33:57,583 --> 00:33:58,833
Dasar bajingan!

365
00:33:58,917 --> 00:34:01,042
Charli! Keluar dari tokoku!

366
00:34:01,125 --> 00:34:02,625
Charli, sayang, merunduk!

367
00:34:03,958 --> 00:34:06,208
Keluar dari tokoku, Bajingan!

368
00:34:15,083 --> 00:34:16,750
Ayah!

369
00:34:18,167 --> 00:34:19,792
Ayah!

370
00:34:19,875 --> 00:34:21,667
Tidak apa-apa, Sayang!

371
00:34:21,750 --> 00:34:23,583
Tidak apa-apa. Ayah baik-baik saja!

372
00:34:26,167 --> 00:34:28,083
Keluar dari tokoku, dasar…

373
00:34:28,958 --> 00:34:31,667
- Ayah!
- Ayah!

374
00:35:09,125 --> 00:35:11,583
Jauhi tokoku, Bajingan!

375
00:35:11,667 --> 00:35:12,667
Charli!

376
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:26,292
Tolong putriku!

377
00:35:26,375 --> 00:35:29,042
- Tolong putriku! Kumohon!
- Charli, Sayang, merunduk.

378
00:35:29,125 --> 00:35:30,333
Sial, itu Castle!

379
00:35:49,375 --> 00:35:51,000
Charli, Sayang, jangan lihat!

380
00:36:18,292 --> 00:36:19,458
Astaga.

381
00:37:10,292 --> 00:37:13,375
Sayang. Jangan lihat, Sayang!
Tolong jangan lihat.

382
00:37:15,583 --> 00:37:17,792
Terima kasih.

383
00:37:19,125 --> 00:37:20,958
Astaga, terima kasih.

384
00:37:56,458 --> 00:37:57,458
Charli?

385
00:37:59,833 --> 00:38:01,542
- Dre!
- Charli.

386
00:38:01,625 --> 00:38:02,917
Dre.

387
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:05,625
Kemarilah, Charli. Sayang, kemarilah.

388
00:38:05,708 --> 00:38:07,500
Kita baik-baik saja. Kau tak apa-apa?

389
00:38:07,583 --> 00:38:09,667
- Tidak apa-apa…
- Kau hebat.

390
00:38:09,750 --> 00:38:12,458
Kita baik-baik saja. Kau tak apa-apa.

391
00:38:12,542 --> 00:38:14,917
- Baiklah. Kita baik-baik saja.
- Kau hebat.

392
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:17,375
Ayo. Kau bahkan tak bisa berdiri.

393
00:38:17,458 --> 00:38:19,458
Kita baik-baik saja. Apa kabar, Kawan?

394
00:38:19,542 --> 00:38:22,750
- Kau baik-baik saja, Sayang?
- Tunggu.

395
00:38:24,625 --> 00:38:25,625
Charli!

396
00:38:39,458 --> 00:38:42,250
- Tak apa-apa.
- Syukurlah kau baik-baik saja.

397
00:38:43,375 --> 00:38:44,875
Ini untukmu.

398
00:38:57,625 --> 00:39:00,125
- Kau harus ke rumah sakit.
- Tidak. Charli.

399
00:39:01,333 --> 00:39:02,417
Ayo.

400
00:39:02,500 --> 00:39:04,208
Sayang, kau baik-baik saja?

401
00:39:06,458 --> 00:39:07,542
Terima kasih.

402
00:39:07,625 --> 00:39:08,833
Ya.

403
00:39:08,917 --> 00:39:10,500
- Pelan-pelan.
- Syukurlah.

404
00:39:10,583 --> 00:39:11,583
Tenanglah.

405
00:39:12,917 --> 00:39:14,875
Tenang. Kita baik-baik saja sekarang.

406
00:39:14,958 --> 00:39:16,792
Kau hebat.

407
00:39:18,208 --> 00:39:19,208
Terima kasih.

408
00:40:51,917 --> 00:40:53,250
Ayah bertemu seseorang.

409
00:40:56,667 --> 00:40:58,042
Mengingatkan Ayah kepadamu.

410
00:41:02,750 --> 00:41:05,625
Mungkin kau bersama Ayah hari ini, Sayang.

411
00:41:07,292 --> 00:41:10,208
Ya, mungkin kau bersama Ayah.

412
00:41:40,167 --> 00:41:41,167
Ya, Sayang, mungkin…

413
00:41:43,083 --> 00:41:44,875
Mungkin aku akan lanjut terus, ya?

414
00:41:51,250 --> 00:41:52,292
Setumpuk,

415
00:41:54,250 --> 00:41:55,833
dua tumpuk, satu sen dan sepicis.

416
00:41:58,000 --> 00:41:59,417
Ayah Beruang pembuat roti,

417
00:42:00,458 --> 00:42:01,583
aku juga,

418
00:42:04,875 --> 00:42:07,042
Setumpuk, dua tumpuk,
satu sen dan sepicis…

419
00:42:08,792 --> 00:42:11,750
Ya, Ayah sayang kamu, Anak manis.

420
00:42:13,583 --> 00:42:15,042
Sampai akhir masa.

421
00:42:17,292 --> 00:42:18,708
Setumpuk,

422
00:42:20,125 --> 00:42:21,792
dua tumpuk, satu sen dan sepicis…

423
00:42:27,417 --> 00:42:29,458
- Lihat dirimu.
- Apa?

424
00:42:29,542 --> 00:42:32,000
Kau tak bisa sembunyikan.
Terlihat jelas di wajahmu.

425
00:42:32,083 --> 00:42:35,250
- Pukul berapa kereta tiba?
- Pukul 08.27.

426
00:42:35,333 --> 00:42:38,292
- Gerbang berapa?
- 32 B.

427
00:42:38,375 --> 00:42:40,625
- Kau akan beli…
- Aku sudah punya dua.

428
00:42:40,708 --> 00:42:42,958
Satu kacang pecan, satu lagi persik.

429
00:42:43,042 --> 00:42:44,417
Sudah ada di kulkas.

430
00:42:58,625 --> 00:43:01,833
Hei, Devil Dog, topi itu milikku.

431
00:43:06,250 --> 00:43:07,875
Lepaskan itu dari kepala busukmu.

432
00:43:07,958 --> 00:43:09,333
Ambil topinya, Bung.

433
00:43:31,625 --> 00:43:34,167
Bukan hanya itu yang dia ambil dariku.

434
00:43:45,708 --> 00:43:48,292
Tolong jangan, aku mohon.

435
00:43:48,375 --> 00:43:49,667
Jangan.

436
00:44:09,458 --> 00:44:12,125
BERDASARKAN KOMIK MARVEL

437
00:47:55,375 --> 00:47:57,375
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Hadi